  ],
  "instructions": [
    "Rim a highball glass with kosher salt. Squeeze half a lime into a shaker and drop it in. Add the tequila, grapefruit juice, and simple syrup and short shake with 3 ice cubes. Strain into a highball glass filled with ice cubes and top with grapefruit soda. Garnish with the lime wheel and serve with a straw."
  ],
